{"version":1,"content":"<p>【僅 700MB ... 😓】近日，著名 OS 開發者 NTDEV 製作了 Windows 11 Pico 極限精簡版「Pico11」，成功將微軟 Windows 11 系統安裝映像檔（ISO）極致壓縮至 700MB 以下，剛好可燒錄進一張標準 CD-ROM 光碟內。</p><p>該系統不僅能順利開機並載入完整圖形桌面，還能正常執行小算盤、記事本與小畫家等原生應用程式，打破了外界對新一代作業系統體積龐大的既定印象。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T07:43:07.426859+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":203,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T07:27:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T09:58:19.464799+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T07:38:20.119217+00:00","content_hash":"a1d9ac7a12690efc98abf96a69a389bc821de9b3cd0788d964f2b9b2eb5ff11f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}